    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense, thanks. Following up on that—when looking at prognosis and overall outcomes, are there specific ethnic groups that typically have a higher risk of advanced-stage presentation or worse survival rates? Like, is there a biological or demographic trend I should be aware of for my boards?",
